{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1394228-feedback-on-armour-evocations","id":1394228,"title":"Feedback on Armour Evocations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-04T20:41:37-07:00","id":1394228,"title":"Feedback on Armour Evocations","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Forged during the Shogunate, Ebony Fronds was first forged from steel and green jade, heated over ancient willow charcoal, then tempered with vegetable oil and soap and the sap of certain Eastern thistles for the Eastern Outcaste Busujima Clan\u2019s eldest son, Shutaro, who wore it in many battles and in time of peace, set it where rain and sun could reach it. In due course, it passed into the hands of other sons, and less often daughters, of the Clan. As with their other great treasures, the Clan took great pride in knowing that they had never had to ransom it back from their enemies. After the clan\u2019s destruction, it passed into the hands of Saeko Takagi, their former retainer and recently Exalted Dawn Caste.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Created for a man noted for his fastidious nature, the armour keeps itself and its attuned wearer clean, as per the Collar of Dawn\u2019s Cleansing Light. Given the great difficulty of keeping lamellar armour clean and pest-free with its intricate lacings, this is a considerable benefit. It also incorporates a hearthstone socket, which currently holds the keep\u2019s Monkey Stone.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:BlackChancery\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Evocations of Ebony Fronds</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#01A815\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Leaf-Whisper Imitation</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Cost</b>: 3m; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Type</b>: Supplemental</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Keywords</b>: Dissonant, Resonant</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Duration</b>: Instant</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Prerequisites</b>: None</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Ebony Fronds\u2019 overlapping scales become as silent and soft as leaves. This Evocation enhances a Stealth roll made while in plant-based concealment, lowering any penalties by the wearer\u2019s (Essence).</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Special activation rules</b>: As long as the wearer isn\u2019t dissonant with jade, this Evocation awakens at no cost when she successfully ambushes a non-trivial enemy.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Resonant</b>: As long as the wearer\u2019s roll beats at least one non-trivial enemy, she gains a point of Initiative.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#00B30F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Unseen Forest Spirit </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Cost: \u2014; Mins: Essence 1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Type: Permanent</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Keywords: None</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Duration: Permanent</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Invisible Statue Spirit, Leaf-Whisper Imitation</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">This Evocation upgrades Invisible Statue Spirit (Exalted, p. 403). While the Solar is in plant-based concealment, the Charm\u2019s cost is waived.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#01B81E\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Trackless Jungle</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Cost: \u2014; Mins: Essence 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Type: Permanent</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Keywords: None</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Duration: Permanent</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Elusive Forest Shadow, Traceless Passage</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">This Evocation upgrades Traceless Passage (Exalted, p. 412). When the Solar uses it to conceal her tracks while moving through a forest, jungle, or other vegetation-dense terrain, she doubles 7s.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Opinions and feedback sought.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-06T14:45:29-07:00","id":1394630,"title":"","content":"These would just appear to be some of the Evocations of Midnight Thorn, so there isn't much to be said. The names are okay, I guess?<br /> <br /> No, actually, I do like this visual:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> [...] and in time of peace, set it where rain and sun could reach it. </div> </div> </div> You don't really do anything with it, though. Did the armour grow or change in any way due to this treatment? Was it part of defining its nature?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-06T16:30:11-07:00","id":1394654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1394228-feedback-on-armour-evocations?p=1394630#post1394630\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These would just appear to be some of the Evocations of Midnight Thorn, so there isn't much to be said. The names are okay, I guess?<br /> <br /> No, actually, I do like this visual:<br /> <br /> You don't really do anything with it, though. Did the armour grow or change in any way due to this treatment? Was it part of defining its nature?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's my thought that yes, it was part of the original possessor's defining of its nature, and I wasn't sure what effect that might have on its nature or appearance. I'm really looking for suggestions on other Evocations; I'd like to add one more going off Leaf-Whisper Imitation, one going off that, then going from that and Trackless Jungle to a capstone. I have a name for that one: Ghost Who Walks. Sadly, I've nothing to attach to the name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1184,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","user":"LadyLens","date":". 06-07-2020, 03:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-07T07:07:48-07:00","id":1394768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1394228-feedback-on-armour-evocations#post1394228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Special activation rules</b>: As long as the wearer isn\u2019t dissonant with jade, this Evocation awakens at no cost when she successfully ambushes a non-trivial enemy.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div> So the intent is that the 3m cost of the charm is refunded if you successfully ambush a non-trivial opponent?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-07T08:15:43-07:00","id":1394772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1394228-feedback-on-armour-evocations?p=1394768#post1394768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> So the intent is that the 3m cost of the charm is refunded if you successfully ambush a non-trivial opponent?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the intent is that you learn the Charm at no XP cost on a successful Ambush.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-07T10:19:20-07:00","id":1394801,"title":"","content":"Okay that does make more sense, when I read it I was thinking in terms of mote cost rather than xp cost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-14T10:59:47-07:00","id":1396429,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Forged during the Shogunate, Ebony Fronds was first forged from steel and green jade, heated over ancient willow charcoal, then tempered with vegetable oil and soap and the sap of certain Eastern thistles for the Eastern Outcaste Busujima Clan\u2019s eldest son, Shutaro, who wore it in many battles and in time of peace, set it where rain and sun could reach it. In due course, it passed into the hands of other sons, and less often daughters, of the Clan. As with their other great treasures, the Clan took great pride in knowing that they had never had to ransom it back from their enemies. After the clan\u2019s destruction, it passed into the hands of Saeko Takagi, their former retainer and recently Exalted Dawn Caste.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Created for a man noted for his fastidious nature, the armour keeps itself and its attuned wearer clean, as per the Collar of Dawn\u2019s Cleansing Light. Given the great difficulty of keeping lamellar armour clean and pest-free with its intricate lacings, this is a considerable benefit. It also incorporates a hearthstone socket, which currently holds the keep\u2019s Monkey Stone.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:BlackChancery\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Evocations of Ebony Fronds</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#01A815\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Leaf-Whisper Imitation</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Cost</b>: 3m; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Type</b>: Supplemental</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Keywords</b>: Dissonant, Resonant</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Duration</b>: Instant</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Prerequisites</b>: None</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Ebony Fronds\u2019 overlapping scales become as silent and soft as leaves. This Evocation enhances a Stealth roll made while in plant-based concealment, lowering any penalties by the wearer\u2019s (Essence).</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Special activation rules</b>: As long as the wearer isn\u2019t dissonant with jade, this Evocation awakens at no cost when she successfully ambushes a non-trivial enemy.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Resonant</b>: As long as the wearer\u2019s roll beats at least one non-trivial enemy, she gains a point of Initiative.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#00B30F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Unseen Forest Spirit </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Cost</b>: \u2014; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Type</b>: Permanent</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Keywords</b>: None</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Duration</b>: Permanent</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Prerequisites</b>: Invisible Statue Spirit, Leaf-Whisper Imitation</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">This Evocation upgrades Invisible Statue Spirit (Exalted, p. 403). While the Solar is in plant-based concealment, the Charm\u2019s cost is waived.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#01B81E\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Trackless Jungle</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Cost</b>: \u2014; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Type</b>: Permanent</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Keywords</b>: None</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Duration</b>: Permanent</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Prerequisites</b>: Elusive Forest Shadow, Traceless Passage</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">This Evocation upgrades Traceless Passage (Exalted, p. 412). When the Solar uses it to conceal her tracks while moving through a forest, jungle, or other vegetation-dense terrain, she doubles 7s.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1DB100\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Lightness of the Birch-Tree</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Cost</b>: 2m; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Type</b>: Simple</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Keywords</b>: None</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Duration</b>: Indefinite</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Prerequisites</b>: Armoured Scout\u2019s Invigoration, Leaf-Whisper Imitation</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">When activated, this Evocation removes Ebony Fronds\u2019 mobility penalty.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1DB100\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Toughness of the Cedar</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Cost</b>: 2m; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Type</b>: Simple</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Keywords</b>: None</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Duration</b>: Indefinite</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Prerequisites</b>: Lightness of the Birch-Tree</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Given a moment\u2019s preparation, the wearer of the armour can cause its scales to grow a bark-like layer of additional protection, increasing Ebony Fronds\u2019 Soak by 2.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1DB100\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Ghost Who Walks</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Cost</b>: 5m; <b>Mins</b>: Essence 5</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Type</b>: Reflexive</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Keywords</b>: Resonant</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Duration</b>: Indefinite</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Prerequisites</b>: Trackless Jungle, Toughness of the Cedar</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">When the character reaches Incapacitated, this Charm both stabilizes the wearer and creates the illusion that the wearer is indeed dead. The illusion remains for as long as the armour is attuned and the Evocation\u2019s motes committed, and can be penetrated with a Difficulty 5 Perception+Awareness roll.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Special Activation Rules</b>: This Evocation awakens at no cost the first time the wearer is reduced to Incapacitated.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}